  On error Set 'scratch found an error already pending' to true,
  a boolean called 'scratch byte read refused' is false,
  a number called 'scratch byte read result' is byte 1 of 'scratch',
  On error Set 'scratch byte read refused' to true,
  If 'scratch byte read refused' is false then, Print "ASSERT BUF-46: expected 1 got {'scratch byte read refused'}", Exit 95. Print 'scratch byte read refused',
  If 'scratch byte read result' is not 0 then, Print "ASSERT BUF-46: expected 0 got {'scratch byte read result'}", Exit 95. Print 'scratch byte read result'.

